            "review_text": "flobo5\nTrevignano Romano, Italy255 contributions\n0\nMai Hac De location\nSep 2015 • Couples\nWe ordered a selection of different dishes and were really impressed by all of them. The presentation was superb and the dipping sauces were really tasty. We both had draft Tiger, which was nice and chilled.\n\nThe problem was the service, which was far too attentive and we were stared at for our whole visit. It was very quiet but staff should be trained to not stare at the customers, I'm sure they could find something better to do. All the staff were perfectly nice but it just made us feel very awkward. If we go back, I'll either go when it's busier or ask to sit in a private room.\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2015",
